{"version":1,"key":"card:144","content":{"id":144,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"471aee82-4a0d-4f0a-b924-898dc9a6a39d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防抖和节流都是防止短时间内多次触发的技术。防抖是为了防止抖动，例如一个表单的提交，用户由于手抖，点了两次提交，如果没有使用防抖，就会发出两次请求，可能造成错误的结果；而节流是为了限制触发的频率，比如我们想监听窗口的滚动事件，如果每次事件触发都进行计算，性能上会有问题，因此我们可以控制触发的频率，提高性能。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b195f17-2ed8-4e84-81ed-12e95384c8be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们一般会使用一个时间来规定事件发生的频率，这个时间记为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对于防抖，如果两次事件触发的时间小于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么会忽略第一个触发的事件，直至事件触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后没有再次触发，我们才进行相应的处理，核心逻辑如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4ce0f2fe-3a17-4f6d-a135-b1aed1bac96a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"72c50ba5-f190-455c-8b8d-0c4ebac0b81d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const debounce = (fn, timeout) => {\n    let timerId;\n\n    return function(...args) {\n        clearTimeout(timerId);\n        timerId = setTimeout(() => {\n            fn.apply(this, args);\n        }, timeout);\n    }\n}","collabId":"b49cfe67-385e-4198-89a8-b77a826e079a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c96e4ca-7693-4e30-ac69-e8a1ff6d0b3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于节流，自上一次事件处理程序执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件内，忽略所有发生的事件，以控制频率，核心逻辑如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"abe9d2d9-360e-40dd-bdf9-e52c341f80ee","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ac6514c0-6021-4bc5-a62b-e7a4ecd0c971","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const throttle = (fn, time) => {\n  \t// 上一次函数执行的时间\n    let pre = 0;\n\n    return function(...args) {\n        let now = Date.now();\n        if (now - pre > time) {\n            fn.apply(this, args);\n            pre = now;\n        }\n    }\n}","collabId":"b0974558-6f9e-460a-86db-045ca56f8166","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690100328128,"updateTime":1767437394611,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767437394611}}